  "m53StocktakeHelp": "Counting guide",
  "m53StocktakeHelpBody": "Drafts are saved without changing stock. A barcode identifies a product type, not each unique piece: the same piece can be counted twice. Choose the physical batch when several exist. Not counted is not 0. After a sale, receipt, product or time zone change, review and recount before finalization. Differences may arise from counting errors, unrecorded transactions, damage or other causes; they are not evidence of theft.",
