  "m53StocktakeRecount": "Capture new baseline and recount",
  "m53StocktakeRecountHelp": "This product’s counts, entered value and undo will be cleared. Stock and batch baselines will be captured again from current data. Count the physical stock again. Stock is unchanged.",
