  "m53StocktakeValue": "Total value of all found stock",
  "m53StocktakeValueHelp": "System stock started at 0, so no previous average exists. Enter the TOTAL value for the full counted quantity, not a price per piece or pack. Blank means unknown and is allowed only when purchase cost is optional. Zero requires free-cost confirmation. Review the value again if the count changes. This is not a new purchase or supplier debt.",
  "m53StocktakeValueDifference": "Estimated value difference",
  "m53StocktakeFinalize": "Review and finalize stocktake",
  "m53StocktakeFinalizeHelp": "Check every product’s baseline, physical count and difference. Stock, batches, value and history update atomically only if the baseline still matches. Results and reason become permanent snapshots. A shortage is not evidence of theft.",
